1b:[["$","title","0",{"children":"Clothing — Shirts, Suits, Blazers & Bottoms · Wardrobecare Clothing"}],["$","meta","1",{"name":"description","content":"Shop Wardrobecare's clothing edits — blazers, casual and formal shirts, polos, suits, t-shirts and hoodies, plus chinos, jeans and trousers. Lagos delivery, nationwide shipping."}],["$","meta","2",{"name":"author","content":"Wardrobecare Clothing"}],["$","meta","3",{"name":"keywords","content":"Wardrobecare,Wardrobecare Clothing,men's fashion Nigeria,distinguished menswear Lagos,men's shirts,polos,trousers,footwear,fragrance,personal shopper Nigeria"}],["$","meta","4",{"name":"creator","content":"Wardrobecare Clothing"}],["$","meta","5",{"name":"robots","content":"index, follow"}],["$","link","6",{"rel":"canonical","href":"https://wardrobecare.com.ng"}],["$","meta","7",{"property":"og:title","content":"Wardrobecare Clothing — Distinguished Men's Fashion"}],["$","meta","8",{"property":"og:description","content":"Your #1 personal shopper for distinguished men's fashion. Curated menswear, delivered across Nigeria."}],["$","meta","9",{"property":"og:url","content":"https://wardrobecare.com.ng"}],["$","meta","10",{"property":"og:site_name","content":"Wardrobecare Clothing"}],["$","meta","11",{"property":"og:locale","content":"en_NG"}],["$","meta","12",{"property":"og:type","content":"website"}],["$","meta","13",{"name":"twitter:card","content":"summary_large_image"}],["$","meta","14",{"name":"twitter:title","content":"Wardrobecare Clothing"}],["$","meta","15",{"name":"twitter:description","content":"Distinguished men's fashion, curated for everyday confidence."}],["$","link","16",{"rel":"icon","href":"/icon.png?icon.21084ecf.png","sizes":"512x512","type":"image/png"}],["$","$L1c","17",{}]]
